      "value": "Interesting, what is the maximum size for an expressions menu icon? For cases where they're checking like all icons or all textures (mip maps on? Better allow streaming) they only kinda tell you what's going on.\n\nBest way to test might be too assign a 2k icon and see what it gets resized to.\n\nBut yeah I agree that it should have like (max 256x256) on the end",
