  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "This error message in the Avatar SDK is really unclear.\n\n\"Select\" does not show anything useful, it only redirects the Inspector to the VRC Avatar Descriptor.\n\nI suppose this is about icons used in menus ? Can the error message please be worded better ?\n\nAuto Fix fixes the problem, but there is no way for the use to know what was the problem and what was changed.",
